{"title":"Shagbark Pestle And Mortar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Carpentry Lv 69)</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Carpentry at level 69 <span class=\"muted\">(2344 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/shagbark-plank\">Shagbark Plank</a>, 3× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-fittings\">Titanium Fittings</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/carpentry\">Carpentry</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/pestle-and-mortar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/93d1da8336a8f5ee7cf8.svg\" alt=\"\">Pestle And Mortar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/oak-pestle-and-mortar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/76f3ad298e897365d235.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Pestle And Mortar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-pestle-and-mortar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/c92c40373889ea00721b.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Pestle And Mortar</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-plank\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/1b65c3eee556804df063.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Plank</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/426de6742aa28902e4da.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Fittings</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/899a5088a75e51b9070a.svg\" alt=\"Shagbark Pestle And Mortar\"></div><h3>Shagbark Pestle And Mortar</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Carpentry 69</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}